# Claude Code. launch.json IS tracked — it is how the dev server gets started,
# so it belongs to the project rather than to one machine. These two do not:
# settings.local.json holds per-machine permission grants, and worktrees/ holds
# throwaway checkouts from other sessions (2MB of stale pre-Eleventy site files
# that would otherwise turn up in every search of this repo).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
